/no question."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Cannibal",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Cannibal"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"You have the ability of the recently killed executee. If they are evil, you are poisoned until a good player dies by execution."],["","      ",{text:"OUTSIDER",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Mutant",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Mutant"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"If you are “mad” about being an Outsider, you might be executed."],["","      ",{text:"OUTSIDER",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Lunatic",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Lunatic"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"You think you are a Demon, but you are not. The Demon knows who you are & who you choose at night."],["","      ",{text:"MINION",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Widow",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Widow"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_red},"On your 1st night, look at the Grimoire & choose a player: they are poisoned. 1 good player knows a Widow is in play."],["","      ",{text:"MINION",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Goblin",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Goblin"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_red},"If you publicly claim to be the Goblin when nominated & are e